    dream_id: dream_20260520T222113
    project: nlp_variance_gtheory
    status: done
    review_mode: full
    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: ''
    focus: 'Re-dream after major framing revision addressing all 9 structural issues
      from first dream. Key changes: (1) infrastructure crossing reframed as confirmatory
      null, not primary novelty; (2) cross-benchmark variance gradient is now the
      primary finding; (3) item dominance acknowledged as psychometrically expected,
      contribution is quantification+gradient; (4) model treated as crossed facet
      in analysis; (5) bibliography expanded to 25+ refs; (6) 4 figures planned; (7)
      "fully crossed" qualified; (8) "diagnostic tool" either substantiated with code
      release or reframed. Verify whether these framing changes address the weak reject
      scores from first dream.'
